OL,3,AFather and son's 'cheeky' cut-out book 
OL,4,Awins prize                             
OL,6,FWaterstones head of books Bea Carvalho 
OL,7,Fdescribed Is This a Plum? as           
OL,8,F"picture-book perfection". She said it 
OL,9,Fwas "endlessly re-readable, a cheeky   
OL,10,Ftreat for little ones, with plenty of  
OL,11,Fnostalgia appeal for grown-ups".       
